    keyTakeaways: ["PoS-driven demand predicción can reduce food waste in small-format minorista and food-service operations by 15 to 30 percent through more accurate pedidoing of perishable products.", "The economic savings from waste reduction — encompassing both aanulacióned purchase costos and reduced disposal gastos — typically exceed the costo of implementing PoS-based predicción systems.", "The environmental impact of PoS-driven waste reduction, measured in carbon-equivalent emissions, is substantial when aggregated across the thousands of small food businesses in a given market."],
