        a: "Well-designed predicción systems explicitly balance waste reduction against inventarioout risk, using service-level metas that the operator can adjust based on their specific costo preferences. The objetivo is not to eliminate all surplus but to reduce it to a level consistent with the meta availability. Safety-inventario calculations for perishables account for demand uncertainty and replenishment lead times to maintain desired service levels.",
