        q: "Can markdown optimización work without detailed price-response data?",
        a: "Yes, though with reduced optimality. When product-specific price-response data is limited, the DP formulation can use category-level demand elasticity estimates or simple heuristic demand models (e.g., demand doubles at 50% markdown). These approximations still outperform fixed schedules because they incorporate sell-through monitoring, even if the price-response model is imprecise.",
